e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Resident of the Republic of Marshall Islands\n-  Aged 18 - 75 years\n-  HbA1c ≥ 8.0% or diagnosed with T2D and taking diabetes medication\n-  Medical clearance to participate from Diabetes Wellness Center (DWC) physicians.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Resident of the Republic of Marshall Islands"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Aged 18 - 75 years"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- HbA1c \\u2265 8.0%",\n              "Observation": [\n                "HbA1c"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or diagnosed"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "with T2D and taking diabetes medication",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "T2D"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "diabetes medication"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Medical clearance to participate from Diabetes Wellness Center (DWC) physicians."\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
