e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  current cardiovascular disease (CVD) (ischemic heart disease, peripheral artery disease, and stroke)\n-  malignant diseases\n-  serious systemic or mental diseases\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- current cardiovascular disease (CVD) (ischemic heart disease, peripheral artery disease, and stroke)",\n          "Condition": [\n            "cardiovascular disease",\n            "CVD",\n            "ischemic heart disease",\n            "peripheral artery disease",\n            "stroke"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- malignant diseases",\n          "Condition": [\n            "malignant diseases"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- serious systemic"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or mental diseases",\n          "Condition": [\n            "diseases"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
